  "note": "The Psalm verb is qal. Arabic بَرَأَ shares the creation sense, while the same Hebrew root also has health and clearing senses elsewhere. The two verb keys return identical surfaces. The single verb records the stems under b.cw.aa. Ezk 34:20 has the contracted adjective בִרְיָה. SEDRA distinguishes two agent nouns."
